  - text: We fight for independence. In the words of our culture, we will give our
      lives, but we will never give up our freedom.
    author: '-: Rani Lakshmibai :-'
  - text: If a man says he is not afraid of dying, he is either lying or he is a
      Gorkha.
    author: '-: Sam Manekshaw :-'
  - text: The safety, honour and welfare of your country come first, always and every
      time.
    author: '-: K M Cariappa :-'
